# Local Apple restore inputs and generated images
/apple/
/out/
/build/
/reference/
/refer/
/firmware/
# The Bluetooth firmware set is vendor data pulled from the device; only its
# manifest is tracked, so a clean checkout can still stage and verify the bytes.
!firmware/bluetooth/
firmware/bluetooth/*
!firmware/bluetooth/manifest.json
/artifacts/
/evidence/
*.ipsw
*.dmg
*.cdr
*.img
*.bin
*.fw
